{title:BNR annual report Step 3: Publish the approved report}

{title:What this step does}

{pstd}
Step 3 verifies and publishes the exact annual-report package approved in Step
2, including the report, public-health update, website page and metadata.

{title:Before you run it}

{pstd}
An unchanged Step 2 approval, manifest and public-ready package must exist for
the selected report year and version.

{title:What to enter}

{phang}{bf:Report year and version} must match the approved Step 2 package.

{phang}{bf:Authorise replacement} should normally remain unticked. Use it only
for an authorised recovery or republication of the same approved version.

{title:After running}

{pstd}
Confirm all published files and landing pages listed in the final summary.
Render and inspect the website before deployment.

{title:Full instructions}

{pstd}
See the {browse "https://uwi-bnr.github.io/info-hub/technical/workflows/reporting/annual-report.html":Technical Manual: Build, approve and publish an annual CVD report}.
